    },
    {
      "id": "381c17a8-fb59-5249-897c-475fbb02f1ed",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "훈련 중 {name} 선수가 손목을 붙잡았다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "During practice, {name} grabbed their wrist.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "003be174-6f98-51db-8086-0a471ae0f4e3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "괜찮아요… 조금 시큰한 정도예요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I'm fine… it's just a little sore.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e664ff5-5611-5188-8502-64c66dc5d3a3",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
